## Reviewer points not followed
- pt-b #20's suggested "filial" for a company with its own legal personality. In Portugal and Brazil that word is a branch. The part-a pattern, and the gloss 子公司, call for subsidiária. Sucursal stays on 分公司.
- "competência internacional do tribunal" and the statute name "elemento estrangeiro" (涉外民事法律適用法) are the right terms. Only the calque "elemento internacional" / "família internacional" was rewritten as transfronteiriço.
- "estaleiro" in 004 is the tax-treaty construction permanent establishment, which is the European Portuguese term. The 012 roadwork "estaleiros" were changed to "zonas de obras"; that fix was not copied onto the construction-site PE.
- pt-b #28 cannot be one paragraph. The checker compares block counts, so the comma-break was closed inside the two existing blocks.
- "Se o interessado pretender explorar por si próprio" in 011 was left. "Próprio" agrees with "o interessado". The ungrammatical cases (the heading with no subject, and "constitui por si próprio") were rewritten.
